# Fish universal variables — example template
#
# The real `fish_variables` file is intentionally NOT tracked in this repo:
# fish stores exported secrets (API keys) in it verbatim.
#
# Do not copy this file over your existing `fish_variables` — fish manages that
# file itself and rewrites it on change. Instead, set the values you need once,
# from an interactive shell:
#
#   set -Ux OMNIROUTE_API_KEY "your-api-key-here"
#
# To confirm what is currently set:
#
#   set -U
#
# To remove one:
#
#   set -e OMNIROUTE_API_KEY
